1
00:00:07,670 --> 00:00:10,240
I want you to marry me.

2
00:00:11,070 --> 00:00:13,280
<i>I'm a phony...</i>

3
00:00:13,710 --> 00:00:15,700
<i>A fiancée in name only.</i>

4
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:21,610
<i>The place I belong is already...</i>

5
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:27,260
<i>Now I can't freely enter the royal archives.</i>

6
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:29,420
<i>This is unfortunate.</i>

7
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:33,180
I'll make sure you have your free time.

8
00:00:33,180 --> 00:00:34,680
I promise you.

9
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:38,560
Yes. But the jewel pales in comparison to you.

10
00:00:38,990 --> 00:00:41,440
I thought you might like it.

11
00:00:45,360 --> 00:00:50,570
<i>I at least want to hear it with my own ears
and not just wait for the time to come!</i>

12
00:00:51,220 --> 00:00:54,830
<i>Even if our engagement is cancelled...</i>

13
00:00:55,440 --> 00:01:00,010
<i>His Highness is not the type to treat me cruelly.</i>

14
00:01:01,620 --> 00:01:05,920
L-Lady Elianna, I thought
you wouldn't visit the castle today?

15
00:01:06,450 --> 00:01:09,050
Will you please give His Highness a message for me?

16
00:01:09,050 --> 00:01:11,130
O-One moment, ple—

17
00:01:12,510 --> 00:01:15,720
Quiet down. Is something— Huh?

18
00:01:16,030 --> 00:01:18,500
Lord Glen. I came for His Highness...

19
00:01:19,930 --> 00:01:26,520
I had no idea that you had any interest
in such handicrafts, Prince Christopher.

20
00:01:26,880 --> 00:01:30,400
Perhaps because you're a good storyteller, Lady Irene.

21
00:01:32,460 --> 00:01:38,040
No doubt any crafted work I gave you for a gift,
would pale in comparison to your house's craftsman.

22
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:45,040
<i>I see now... it looks like I misunderstood how things were. </i><i></i>

23
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:49,050
<i>It seems that the gift that His Highness gave to me... </i><i></i>

24
00:01:49,360 --> 00:01:51,770
<i>didn't mean anything to him.</i><i></i>

25
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:56,050
Eli?!

26
00:01:56,580 --> 00:02:00,680
Your Highness. Please excuse me
for entering without permission.

27
00:02:00,680 --> 00:02:03,310
Of course, I don't mind.

28
00:02:03,310 --> 00:02:06,630
I thought you were to visit your aunt today.

29
00:02:08,820 --> 00:02:11,570
Your Highness, don't say it like that...

30
00:02:12,300 --> 00:02:17,320
I thank you for your concern about my aunt's condition.

31
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:23,580
However, I had a small matter to attend to today,
and I apologize for interrupting your delightful chat.

32
00:02:23,580 --> 00:02:25,830
A-And what would that be?

33
00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:30,210
It's regarding the book
that you gifted me with the other day...

34
00:02:30,630 --> 00:02:32,460
I'll be returning it to you.

35
00:02:32,460 --> 00:02:33,720
Huh?

36
00:02:34,150 --> 00:02:35,670
I no longer need it.

37
00:02:40,470 --> 00:02:42,020
If you will excuse me.

38
00:02:49,750 --> 00:02:52,110
<i>How am I noticing it just now?</i>

39
00:02:52,860 --> 00:02:53,990
<i>I...</i>

40
00:02:56,460 --> 00:03:00,370
<i>am in love with Prince Christopher.</i>

41
00:03:01,910 --> 00:03:07,590
<i>But His Highness has already found someone he loves.</i>

42
00:03:09,170 --> 00:03:12,000
<i>No matter the plethora of books I read,</i>

43
00:03:13,110 --> 00:03:15,540
<i>no matter the knowledge I acquire,</i>

44
00:03:16,700 --> 00:03:18,780
<i>it had proved completely useless. </i><i></i>

45
00:03:20,320 --> 00:03:25,230
<i>I pretended to not see where the wind was blowing,
and even tried to put up a front of not caring... </i><i></i>

46
00:03:26,750 --> 00:03:30,330
<i>But my heart still knew the truth deep down.</i><i></i>

47
00:03:31,330 --> 00:03:32,480
<i>What a foolish...</i>

48
00:03:33,610 --> 00:03:38,280
<i>and over-thinking... bibliophile princess.</i>

